WEBVTT

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:09.490
Roaming the world... in search of precious treasure!

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:12.420
Yo, Swordsgirl!

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:15.320
Rare to see you out so late.

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.940
Are you headed to Duke's place?

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:19.540
How about I join you?

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:22.620
Don't touch me.

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:23.850
Come on.

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:25.780
You're grumpier than usual-

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:28.340
You're kidding, right?

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:30.210
You think so?

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:32.690
I got it! I got it!

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:34.500
Geez.

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:43.490
I see, so this is where you are.

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:24.620
Good morning!

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:27.010
Oh, good morning!

00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:29.720
You're cleaning this early in the morning?

00:02:29.720 --> 00:02:31.580
An inspector is coming, it seems.

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:34.470
Inspector?

00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:36.550
Some big shot from Central City.

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:40.800
His job is to watch over our work, and make sure we aren't making any mistakes or errors.

00:02:41.150 --> 00:02:42.440
Heh...

00:02:42.440 --> 00:02:44.850
A lot of people have been coming here lately.

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:46.100
Don't just stand there.

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:47.770
Lend us a hand.

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:50.730
You'll find it's quite annoying if the inspector's watching you.

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:53.410
Oh, okay, I got it.

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:56.730
Um, what should I do today?

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:01.860
I'm the only one cleaning.

00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:08.730
Huh, Linca-san too?

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:12.890
I asked Marion to let me help since she looked so busy.

00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:14.920
Same here.

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:16.590
Nine, and that makes ten!

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:18.310
Perfect.

00:03:18.310 --> 00:03:20.060
Enough for a round of drinks.

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:23.090
We've received numerous reports of monsters lately.

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:24.290
We'll need your help again soon.

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:26.140
Do you need us to clean in here too?

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:27.060
Yo!

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:28.930
No, it's fine.

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:32.390
The homunculi clean this place every day.

00:03:32.390 --> 00:03:35.330
Hey, Swordsgirl, I'm sorry about last night.

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:37.490
I was just messing with you.

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:38.320
Last night?

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:40.790
I'll take you out for lunch next time.

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:42.980
Don't let it bother you.

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:44.990
Did something happen?

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:47.030
No, nothing I know of.

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:59.750
Lucille-chan, is the paperwork from last month over there?

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:01.620
Um...

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:03.430
Yes, it's here!

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:06.550
Um, we're done cleaning.

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:08.810
Stop!

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.640
Sorry, but you can't come in right now.

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:11.890
Huh?

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:15.450
Then what should we do?

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:17.020
Well...

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:22.780
"Just go ahead and take a break."

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:25.970
It's true we can't help with paperwork, but...

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:28.200
By the way, Escha, where are we going?

00:04:28.840 --> 00:04:30.770
We're going to Nio-san's place.

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:32.790
She always has delicious tea...

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:34.450
Linca-san?

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:36.210
In that case, I cannot go.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:42.170
Marion told me not to hang around those two too much.

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:46.350
A little bit won't hurt, will it?

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:47.140
Escha!

00:04:47.610 --> 00:04:52.480
I think Nio-san and Wilbell-san will be happy to see you!

00:04:57.890 --> 00:05:00.230
I-I declined, but...

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:02.910
Oh, no, I'm happy you're here.

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:04.090
See?

00:05:04.090 --> 00:05:07.270
Somehow, this brings back old memories.

00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:10.110
Of Linca-san, Marion-san,

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:11.730
and Onee-chan.

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:17.670
Linca?

00:05:20.780 --> 00:05:22.150
Good, everyone's here!

00:05:22.150 --> 00:05:24.610
How dare you waltz in without a care.

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:25.630
Wilbell-san?

00:05:25.910 --> 00:05:28.250
Or are you provoking me?

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:30.840
Should I treat you to some more magic then?

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:36.250
It looks like I really should not have come.

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:37.980
Linca-san!

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:42.770
Wilbell-san, that was mean!

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:43.810
Mean?

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:45.530
That's my line!

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:47.740
You see, last night...

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:52.950
Good evening.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:58.530
Oh, hey. It's quite unusual for you to talk to me.

00:05:58.530 --> 00:06:00.670
I'm Linca.

00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:02.800
What? I know that.

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:09.720
Looks like... I wasn't mistaken!

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:15.350
He- What was that for?!

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:23.570
You...!

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:27.780
What is this?!

00:06:28.470 --> 00:06:32.370
Since you're up for it, let's settle this!

00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:38.790
Why would Linca-san...?

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:39.700
Who knows?

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:41.260
I wanted to ask her myself.

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:43.050
Hold on a moment!

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:45.450
Linca-san wouldn't do something like that without reason!

00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:47.770
Are you saying this is my fault?!

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:00.370
Something must be wrong.

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:01.180
Escha!

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:01.600
Yes?

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:07.490
That was a rather long break, Escha Malier-san.

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:09.240
Huh? Who's this kid?

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:17.680
This is the inspector who has been assigned to our branch today, Micie Sun Mussemburg.

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:20.160
Inspector?!

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:21.210
I'm sorry!

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:23.000
Allow me to introduce myself again.

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.190
I'm Micie.

00:07:24.190 --> 00:07:25.840
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:28.710
You are quite young for an inspector.

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:30.270
Hey, that's a rude thing to say.

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:32.220
No, it's as he said.

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:36.740
It's true that I'm still young and inexperienced.

00:07:36.740 --> 00:07:43.230
Which is why I shall be extra careful to observe without hindering your work.

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:45.410
He's pretty diligent.

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:47.730
Yeah, that's an inspector for you.

00:07:47.990 --> 00:07:53.600
As your inspector, I understand everyone here must feel ill at ease.

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:59.650
However, your attitude earlier reflects poorly on the whole branch, Linca-san.

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:00.910
Eh?

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:04.880
Did you do something rude?

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:06.650
Not at all!

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:08.730
That was my first time meeting him!

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:10.210
Well, fine.

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:11.500
Everyone listen up.

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:14.890
Pay close attention to your behaviour so you don't upset the inspector.

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:16.890
Wait, Marion!

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.890
I really don't recall doing anything!

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:21.850
I'm telling you it's okay!

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:28.850
Hey, Escha!

00:08:28.850 --> 00:08:32.450
Oh, yes, we're going to buy those ingredients that just came in, right?

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:34.530
No, you just passed it.

00:08:36.770 --> 00:08:38.230
Something on your mind?

00:08:38.230 --> 00:08:39.650
Yeah, sort of.

00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:41.650
Hey, Boss, you're slow!

00:08:41.650 --> 00:08:43.690
Hurry up and bring me another pint!

00:08:43.690 --> 00:08:45.290
Yeah, sorry 'bout that!

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:47.220
Linca-san?

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:48.090
Hey!

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:50.710
Uh... Escha-chan and Logy-kun, is it?

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:52.460
Would you two like a pint?

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:54.930
No, we're still working.

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:56.310
Are you drinking?

00:08:56.310 --> 00:08:57.530
That's right.

00:08:57.530 --> 00:08:59.870
Man, this pub sure is awesome!

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:01.430
I can come here every day!

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:03.790
Hey, you only just figured that out?

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:06.200
This has always been the best pub around!

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:08.310
You speak the truth!

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:10.980
I can vouch for that!

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:13.110
Yo!

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:14.610
Yo!

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:16.610
How about a pint?

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:18.490
Cheers!

00:09:22.710 --> 00:09:23.700
Another one!

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:26.010
It's my first time seeing Linca-san like this.

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:28.730
Yeah, it's like she's a different person.

00:09:29.720 --> 00:09:31.100
Yeah, that's right!

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:34.300
I'm Linca, but I'm different from Linca!

00:09:34.820 --> 00:09:35.820
This isn't good.

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:37.300
She can't even hold a conversation.

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:39.980
Phew! You're all right, you know.

00:09:39.980 --> 00:09:42.110
Put it on Linca's tab!

00:09:42.110 --> 00:09:43.450
Got it!

00:09:46.630 --> 00:09:49.720
You ready to settle this?

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:54.150
Mind showing me that trick once again, you street performer?

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:57.860
Fine, but it'll cost you.

00:09:58.870 --> 00:10:00.450
Good morn... ing...

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:05.680
What's wrong?

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:07.870
Um, Linca-senpai...

00:10:08.970 --> 00:10:11.000
An invoice for property damage?

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:13.050
That's for the day before yesterday.

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:14.250
And here's one for yesterday.

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:15.460
Yesterday?

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:16.560
Yes.

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:19.080
According to our witness' testimony...

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:20.390
Katla?

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:22.520
It was yesterday night.

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:26.710
I worked until late, so I was hurrying home.

00:10:26.710 --> 00:10:29.470
That's when I saw her.

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:43.800
I didn't want to admit it, but it was...

00:10:45.340 --> 00:10:47.120
...all Linca-san's doing!

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:48.710
What? No!

00:10:49.130 --> 00:10:50.850
Are you sure?

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:52.270
Sadly, yes.

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:53.730
That's impossible.

00:10:53.730 --> 00:10:56.430
Linca was with me all night.

00:10:56.430 --> 00:11:00.590
Others have testified that she was at the Dragon's Fist Tavern.

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:01.680
There's no way...!

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:03.430
I saw that too.

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:04.610
Eh?

00:11:04.610 --> 00:11:05.430
Right, Escha?

00:11:06.030 --> 00:11:09.690
Yes, I saw her, but... well...

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:11.070
Escha-senpai?

00:11:11.070 --> 00:11:13.010
Something felt off, though.

00:11:13.010 --> 00:11:15.570
It's like Linca-san was a different person yesterday.

00:11:15.910 --> 00:11:16.780
Different person?

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:20.020
Hey, what did Linca do at the bar yesterday?

00:11:20.020 --> 00:11:21.630
She was drinking.

00:11:21.630 --> 00:11:23.840
So much that we started to worry.

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:25.790
I don't drink!

00:11:25.790 --> 00:11:27.110
But yesterday...

00:11:27.110 --> 00:11:29.630
I see. That explains it.

00:11:29.630 --> 00:11:30.620
I got it!

00:11:31.070 --> 00:11:33.610
Linca, Linca's here.

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:37.600
S-So that's what it is!

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:38.450
How dare she!

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:40.650
Does she want money this time?!

00:11:40.650 --> 00:11:41.840
That's low!

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:44.740
Um, what's going on?

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:46.100
What's the matter?

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:49.510
It's a long story.

00:12:03.230 --> 00:12:07.200
There are people who look so much like me, it's like we're sisters.

00:12:08.010 --> 00:12:09.630
They look like you?

00:12:09.630 --> 00:12:12.650
Now that you mention it, she had a different vibe about her.

00:12:12.650 --> 00:12:13.920
Is she your twin?

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:16.920
It's not that simple.

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:18.230
It's as she said.

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:20.260
There are several Lincas.

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:21.470
Huh?

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:25.100
She might still be in town.

00:12:25.100 --> 00:12:26.970
Let's split up and find her.

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:28.650
Remember that she's very dangerous.

00:12:28.650 --> 00:12:31.120
Come find me if you run across her.

00:12:38.550 --> 00:12:39.530
I'm so pissed!

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:42.030
Wilbell-san!

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:46.780
Um, have you seen someone who looks just like Linca-san?

00:12:47.190 --> 00:12:48.300
Linca?

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:50.280
If I find her, I won't let her off so easily!

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:51.990
Listen to me! Yesterday night...

00:12:51.990 --> 00:12:53.540
About that...

00:12:55.160 --> 00:13:02.550
When I was a kid, the other Lincas and I were
repeatedly ordered to do evil things to others.

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:04.300
Sounds complicated.

00:13:05.860 --> 00:13:06.950
Yes.

00:13:07.650 --> 00:13:11.520
We eventually lost the war and were captured.

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:16.980
Marion, an enemy at that time, was the one who saved me.

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:22.110
Things got very difficult for her after saving me.

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:23.530
I see.

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:25.350
That's why she was assigned to the outskirts.

00:13:25.350 --> 00:13:29.740
If they knew about my past, Escha and the others would probably dislike me.

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:32.870
I don't think that would happen.

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:39.230
I know that there are at least eight Lincas who got away, including myself.

00:13:39.230 --> 00:13:40.930
There are eight Lincas?

00:13:40.930 --> 00:13:42.250
She must be one of them.

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:46.130
Eh? You mean that Linca yesterday night was somebody else?!

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:46.930
Seems like it.

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:49.310
This is the first time I've heard this.

00:13:49.310 --> 00:13:52.390
They look alike, but give off different vibes.

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:54.090
She was very energetic.

00:13:54.090 --> 00:13:55.230
Energetic?

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:56.450
Her?

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:58.340
She might still be in town.

00:13:58.340 --> 00:14:00.060
Everyone's looking for her!

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:01.600
I see.

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:03.190
That's quite interesting.

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:05.680
If you're looking for someone, just leave it to me!

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:09.770
This way!

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:13.490
Not here, huh?

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:14.950
Logy-senpai!

00:14:15.230 --> 00:14:17.010
Lucille, how's it on your end!

00:14:17.010 --> 00:14:18.170
I found her!

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:19.170
You did?!

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:20.670
Yes, right there!

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:22.800
Yo!

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:25.840
We meet again, Logy-kun!

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:27.980
Linca-san?

00:14:27.980 --> 00:14:28.990
Yeah, she was here.

00:14:28.990 --> 00:14:30.350
Where is she now?

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:34.870
She was looking for Wilbell-san, so she probably went to Nio-san's.

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:35.720
Did you two miss her?

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:38.480
What the hell did you do?!

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:39.690
What?

00:14:39.990 --> 00:14:41.390
Nio's in danger!

00:14:41.390 --> 00:14:42.550
Let's go back!

00:14:42.550 --> 00:14:44.270
Hey!

00:14:47.730 --> 00:14:49.570
I thought you didn't drink, Linca-san.

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:52.670
Draft is the best friend of a rough life!

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:55.050
It's a waste not to drink!

00:14:55.050 --> 00:14:57.530
You aren't Linca-san, are you?

00:14:58.090 --> 00:14:59.270
Too bad!

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:01.830
She's Linca, but I'm also Linca!

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:04.530
Judging from the way you speak, you're No. 3, right?

00:15:05.010 --> 00:15:05.550
Um...

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:08.560
Yep, you're right!

00:15:08.560 --> 00:15:10.830
They really look alike!

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:14.430
It's been so long, so let's have a nice chat, my youngest sister!

00:15:18.260 --> 00:15:19.470
Nio!

00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:26.930
Linca-san?!

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:29.070
That Linca-san's an imposter!

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:31.790
Stop right there!

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:34.630
Sorry, I'll explain later!

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:38.950
I don't want to be friends with the other Lincas!

00:15:39.310 --> 00:15:41.830
Come on, it's okay.

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:45.470
Okay, sit here.

00:15:45.470 --> 00:15:48.050
Boss, another pint over here!

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:49.710
S-Stop it!

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:51.300
I'm not very good with alcohol!

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:53.750
Geez, you haven't changed!

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:55.680
Boss, get me some juice instead!

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:57.470
Okay, your juice!

00:15:57.470 --> 00:15:58.310
What the hell?!

00:15:58.580 --> 00:16:00.590
Why are there two of you?

00:16:00.590 --> 00:16:02.310
Took you long enough to notice.

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:04.350
You can't tell them apart.

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:07.320
Stop right there!

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:10.780
What a pain!

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:14.360
W-Wilbell-san!

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:15.910
What's the fuss?

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:16.910
What's going on?

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:18.430
It's a sword!

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:19.410
What's she doing?!

00:16:19.650 --> 00:16:21.590
Geez! What should I do?

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:23.920
I can't use magic in front of so many people!

00:16:25.160 --> 00:16:26.640
If you aren't going to attack...

00:16:26.640 --> 00:16:27.500
Wait up!

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:32.420
It's the real Linca-san!

00:16:33.570 --> 00:16:34.760
There really are two of them.

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:36.550
It's been a while.

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:39.470
I was hoping to have some more fun.

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:42.070
Judging from the way you speak, you're No. 1, right?

00:16:42.070 --> 00:16:43.380
So you're here too.

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:44.070
Too?

00:16:44.070 --> 00:16:45.880
What's with the fuss out here?

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:46.850
What?!

00:16:46.850 --> 00:16:48.820
There's three Linca-sans?!

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:50.190
Oh, Nee-san?

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:51.650
No. 3, huh?

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:56.660
Well, I don't know what's going on,
but things just got pretty interesting.

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:58.280
Right, Linca?!

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:00.080
You don't learn, do you?

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:04.970
What's going on?

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:06.400
I don't really...

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:08.920
Well, we don't get to do this often, so I'm in!

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:11.420
Be good, and become my woman.

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:14.590
I don't belong to anyone!

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:19.260
Nee-san, it's been a while!

00:17:19.630 --> 00:17:21.270
What? Are you drunk?

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:24.340
You're just going to make things even worse!

00:17:24.340 --> 00:17:25.890
Fall back!

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:29.310
We're all sisters here, so what's wrong with it?

00:17:29.630 --> 00:17:32.610
I'll take care of both of you at once.

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:34.950
What am I watching?

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:42.590
I don't feel like doing this anymore.

00:17:42.590 --> 00:17:44.150
Let's stop here today.

00:17:44.150 --> 00:17:45.910
Leave this town immediately!

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:49.120
You're my property, and yet you're so cheeky.

00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:50.720
I've told you many times!

00:17:50.720 --> 00:17:52.590
I'm not your property!

00:17:52.990 --> 00:17:54.650
You can say that however many times you want.

00:17:54.650 --> 00:17:57.270
Linca, you're mine.

00:17:57.270 --> 00:18:01.600
I will take you and everything you hold dear away.

00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:10.900
Geez, what a bothersome sister.

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:17.920
Are you guys okay?

00:18:17.920 --> 00:18:19.180
Marion.

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:24.450
There are three Swordsgirls?!

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:25.810
Yeah.

00:18:25.810 --> 00:18:28.210
I was surprised when I saw two of them, but then there were three!

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:29.210
I was shocked!

00:18:29.730 --> 00:18:32.250
And here I missed such a rare sight.

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:39.430
I was just fooling around.

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:42.100
Who would've thought Ichi-neesan would be here too?

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.990
Um, are you leaving already?

00:18:44.990 --> 00:18:46.160
You two finally met.

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:47.720
Shouldn't you talk more?

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:50.560
Well, I'm here to see how this Linca is doing.

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:53.520
She seems to be getting along with everyone, so I'm not worried.

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:55.650
Well, then.

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:56.860
Wait.

00:18:57.450 --> 00:18:59.900
What do you plan on doing from now on?

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:03.160
If you aren't hostile, we can explain to Marion...

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:03.950
I'll pass.

00:19:04.270 --> 00:19:06.940
I don't plan on working with those guys from Central.

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:10.080
Besides, I'm still searching.

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:11.500
Searching?

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:15.250
Hey, won't you call me what you did when we were little?

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:18.970
Well, it's okay.

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:21.610
I'm glad I got to talk to you after so long.

00:19:21.610 --> 00:19:23.470
Let's have a drink together the next time we meet.

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:26.570
No, beer is a little...

00:19:27.390 --> 00:19:28.790
See you.

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:36.400
Linca-san.

00:19:36.930 --> 00:19:39.550
Are you thinking about your sister?

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:40.810
Yes.

00:19:40.810 --> 00:19:45.600
I'm dreadfully sorry for pulling all of you into our fight.

00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:47.990
No. 3 didn't cause much trouble, but No. 1 went too far.

00:19:48.740 --> 00:19:51.580
If she comes again, I'll defeat her.

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:53.520
Defeat?!

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:54.850
But you're sisters!

00:19:54.850 --> 00:19:56.210
I wouldn't mind if it was just me,

00:19:56.210 --> 00:19:58.480
but I can't forgive her for harming my friends.

00:19:58.480 --> 00:20:01.800
But you should try to get along together.

00:20:02.370 --> 00:20:06.200
Escha, after this, what do you think of Linca?

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:07.010
Eh?

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:09.730
Knowing that there are bad Lincas out there,

00:20:09.730 --> 00:20:11.690
aren't you scared?

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:15.670
No, I'm a bit surprised, but how can I be scared?

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:16.940
It's not just Escha and I.

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:19.650
Nobody here ever thought that.

00:20:20.550 --> 00:20:23.360
We all have the same opinion as Chief Marion.

00:20:26.350 --> 00:20:29.290
The bad Linca... and the travelling Linca.

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:34.110
We are all Lincas, yet why are we so different?

00:20:34.110 --> 00:20:36.310
If we were all the same, we wouldn't fight-

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:37.670
You're not the same.

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:40.190
Right, Logy-san?

00:20:40.190 --> 00:20:41.100
Yeah.

00:20:41.100 --> 00:20:43.620
You're all different.

00:20:43.620 --> 00:20:47.010
You might look the same, but Linca-san is Linca-san.

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:52.730
Linca.

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:55.030
Marion.

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:58.880
Let's have dinner here tonight.

00:20:58.880 --> 00:21:00.200
Aren't you all hungry?

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:01.590
I'll treat you.

00:21:01.590 --> 00:21:02.500
Yay!

00:21:02.500 --> 00:21:03.440
Really?

00:21:03.440 --> 00:21:04.320
Oh, yeah!

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:06.270
Here.

00:21:06.270 --> 00:21:07.360
A bill?

00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:07.780
What?!

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:11.150
It's the girl's sister's tab.

00:21:11.150 --> 00:21:12.190
Take care of it.

00:21:12.190 --> 00:21:13.870
Why so much?

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:15.920
This month's living expenses...

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:19.170
Oh yeah, you two share your funds.

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:21.170
I'm sorry, Marion!

00:21:21.590 --> 00:21:23.520
Speaking of which, Linca-san.

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:26.430
What is your sister No. 3 searching for?

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:28.360
That's...

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:31.890
...our mother.

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:37.230
How about it? Want to come with me?

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:38.530
Hell no.

00:21:38.530 --> 00:21:40.940
If I come with you, I'll stink of beer too.

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:43.050
Okay then, see you.

00:21:45.430 --> 00:21:47.320
Still can't give up on our parents?

00:21:48.090 --> 00:21:51.070
How about you give up on your sister, Ichi-neesan?

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:58.670
It'd be great if you find her, San-neesan.
